562 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 183 0 R
/E (From the very beginning, the goal of this campaign was clear: to close the gap between a quality healthcare provider and the community it was built to serve. Platinum Medical Centre offers world-class medical services, including general consultations, maternal health, laboratory testing, chronic disease management, and more, right on Seke Road in Chitungwiza. Yet many residents in Zengeza, St Mary's, Makoni, and surrounding areas either do not know the clinic exists or believe that quality private healthcare is beyond their reach. This campaign was designed to change that.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
